# OPTIONAL — you do not need this file for the default setup.
#
# By default RSVPs are saved by the bundled API to data/rsvps.xlsx.
# Set this only if you want to post to a Google Apps Script Web App instead
# (required for static-only hosting). See RSVP-SETUP.md, Option B.
#
# Note: anything prefixed with VITE_ is bundled into the public JavaScript,
# so treat this URL as public. The script only appends rows — it never
# exposes the sheet's contents.

# VITE_RSVP_ENDPOINT=https://script.google.com/macros/s/XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX/exec
